        "original_id": "38bc1268-6bd9-59aa-b63e-4dd7a071a2dd",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: Sphereland, Flatland\n- People: Dionys Burger, Edwin Abbott Abbott, A Square\n- Companies: Seeley & Co.\n- Places: London\n\nFacts:\n- In 1884, Edwin Abbott Abbott first published Flatland: A Romance of Many Dimensions through Seeley & Co. in London.\n- Edwin Abbott Abbott was an English schoolmaster and wrote Flatland: A Romance of Many Dimensions as a satirical novella under the pen name A Square.\n- In 1965, Dionys Burger published Sphereland: A Fantasy About Curved Spaces and an Expanding Universe as a sequel to Flatland.\n- Sphereland: A Fantasy About Curved Spaces and an Expanding Universe is a novel by Dionys Burger.\n- Flatland is the earlier novel to which Sphereland is the sequel.",
